id morloc
name Morloc
appeared 2016
creators Zebulun Arendsee
tags pl
website https://morloc.io
releaseNotes https://github.com/morloc-project/morloc/blob/master/ChangeLog.md
description Compose functions across languages under a common type system and transform modules into CLIs, APIs, MCPs etc. 
paper https://peerj.com/articles/cs-3435/
fileExtensions loc
writtenIn haskell rust

isOpenSource true
influencedBy haskell python
docs https://morloc-project.github.io/docs
country United States

twitter https://x.com/morlocproject
example
 module m (sum, sumOfSums)
 
 import root-py
 import root-cpp
 
 source Py from "foo.py" ("pmap")
 source Cpp from "foo.hpp" ("sum")
 
 pmap :: (a -> b) -> [a] -> [b]
 
 --' Add up a list of numbers
 sum :: [Real] -> Real
 
 --' Add up a list of lists, summing each in parallel
 sumOfSums :: [[Real]] -> Real
 sumOfSums = sum . pmap sum

githubRepo https://github.com/morloc-project/morloc
 created 2016
 firstCommit 2016

